Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:25.05,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}不妨坦然接受 尝试微笑以对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:29.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}烛华不吝照耀 光芒终将殆尽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:40.32,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}我们依旧奋勇直前 直到燃尽生命之火
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:43.32,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}发得出声音的玩具也好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:46.16,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}能吹飞疼痛的魔法也好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:50.58,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}于我而言都是无价之宝
